{# src/dbml_sharepoint/templates/_cross_web.js.j2
   The cross-web form of apiUrl(): same suffix discipline, pointed at
   ANOTHER site under this tenant root. Included ONLY by deploy.js's logging
   phase, the one place a script reaches the central deployment log, so no
   other emitted script carries the helper unused. Same origin, so the
   session cookies ride along.

   TENANT_ROOT comes from SITE_URL's origin, deliberately NOT from
   `_spPageContextInfo`: the modern pages this is pasted on (CollabHome)
   do not define that global (measured 2026-08-26).

   TWO builders, because a form digest is NOT web-agnostic. `crossWebApi`
   is the `web/`-scoped one every read and write uses; `crossWebDigestUrl`
   is the contextinfo endpoint, which sits at the API root rather than
   under the web scope, and must be the TARGET web's own (live finding
   2026-09-05: a digest issued by the pasted page's web answered 403
   "security validation ... invalid" against another web; that web's own
   digest answered 201). #}
  const TENANT_ROOT = SITE_URL.replace(/\/+$/, '').replace(/\/sites\/.*$/, '');
  const crossWebApi = (site, suffix) =>
    `${TENANT_ROOT}/sites/${odataName(site)}/_api/web/${suffix}`;
  const crossWebDigestUrl = (site) =>
    `${TENANT_ROOT}/sites/${odataName(site)}/_api/contextinfo`;
